80474524231,\"hasSuicideTopics\":false,\"updatedTime\":0,\"authorTribeUser\":null,\"__isCredentialContainer\":\"Answer\",\"authorCredential\":{\"id\":\"TGlmZUV4cGVyaWVuY2VDcmVkZW50aWFsQDA6MTU0MjQ2OQ==\",\"__typename\":\"LifeExperienceCredential\",\"__isCredential\":\"LifeExperienceCredential\",\"translatedString\":\"I learn history through the archaeology I study and places I visit.\",\"experience\":{\"id\":\"VG9waWNAMDozMzcw\",\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"tid\":3370,\"name\":\"World History\"},\"description\":\"I learn history through the archaeology I study and places I visit.\",\"isDefault\":false,\"isBad\":false,\"isEnqueued\":false,\"credentialId\":1542469},\"isTranslated\":false,\"url\":\"/How-long-does-it-take-for-a-sacked-or-looted-city-to-recover-in-history-Can-a-completely-razed-city-be-rebuilt/answer/John-38692\",\"isOwnTranslation\":false,\"businessCredential\":null,\"businessAnswer\":null,\"credibilityFacts\":[{\"__typename\":\"AuthorInfoFact\",\"id\":\"QXV0aG9ySW5mb0ZhY3RAMDoyNTY0NDY2Mjk6WzExOTA0LCAyOTQ4ODA5OV0=\",\"viewCount\":29488099,\"answerCount\":11904}],\"sourceNetwork\":null,\"sourceQuestion\":null,\"sourceAnswer\":null,\"effectiveAccessOption\":\"free\",\"monetizationIneligibilityReasons\":[],\"notForReproduction\":false,\"numViews\":921,\"__isVotable\":\"Answer\",\"numUpvotes\":18,\"__isQuoraShareable\":\"Answer\",\"numShares\":1,\"moderationCollapseType\":null,\"numRequesters\":1,\"requesters\":[{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjkwMjI2OTU1\",\"__typename\":\"User\",\"uid\":90226955,\"isAnon\":false,\"useTranslatedName\":false,\"isMachineAnswerBot\":false,\"names\":[],\"adminNames\":[],\"profileUrl\":null}],\"isCommentsDisabled\":false,\"isCollapsedForViewer\":false,\"isModerationLocked\":false,\"moderationCollapseTypeUrl\":null,\"network\":{\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\",\"__typename\":\"Network\",\"contentLanguageCode\":\"en\",\"appealsFormUrl\":\"https://help.quora.com/hc/en/requests/new?ticket_form_id=198746\"},\"collapseOperation\":null,\"numDisplayComments\":1,\"__isReportable\":\"Answer\",\"reportableId\":256446629,\"canViewerReport\":false,\"viewerVoteType\":\"novote\"}},\"cursor\":\"15\"},{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25QYWdlZExpc3RFZGdlOjE2\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionPagedListEdge\",\"node\":{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25SZWxldmFudEFuc3dlckl0ZW0yQDA6MzUwNzgwOTphbnN3ZXI6MTk2MTM1ODg2\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"__isQuestionPagedListItem\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"question\":{\"qid\":3507809,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDozNTA3ODA5\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"When war affects a modern city, how long does it take after fighting ends before city life gets back to normal -- businesses operating at prewar levels, population growth, etc.?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"isQuestionDecanonActive\":true,\"areRelatedAnswersEnabled\":true},\"index\":12,\"isEquivalentAnswer\":false,\"relatedQuestion\":{\"qid\":55534326,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDo1NTUzNDMyNg==\"},\"answer\":{\"originalQuestionIfDifferent\":null,\"id\":\"QW5zd2VyQDA6MTk2MTM1ODg2\",\"aid\":196135886,\"isDeleted\":false,\"isMachineAnswer\":false,\"content\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Deal with it how? Emotionally? Socially? Economically?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"I don\\\\u2019t think any population has been subjected to constant high intensity modern warfare. Modern conventional warfare is simply too expensive. There are definitely populations that experience long term low intensity warfare. Example I can think of are:\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Palestinians in the West Bank and Gaza, who experience frequent low intensity warfare(tactical air strikes, small raids), punctuated with occasional large scale warfare.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Iraqis and Afghans living in the areas of their countries where US-Insurgent conflict is most intense.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"African nations where civil war and terrorist insurgencies are or were in full force, such as the DRC, parts of Nigeria, and the South Sudan region.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"How do these populations deal with war emotionally? Much like soldiers in war, they harden. Death and injury become part of daily life, rather than a shocking event. People get used to the sound of fighting, seeing soldiers march through their area. They learn when and where not to go. And just like soldiers, trauma is rampant. Mental illness, PTSD, anxiety, is all very common. There\\\\u2019s only so much adaptation the mind can do.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Economically? War is typically not very helpful for the economy where it\\\\u2019s being fought. Businesses try and operate, and they try and make due with uncertainties in supplies, customers, and free movement.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"questionPageImpressionHash\":\"answer_ranking|1613124754\",\"viewerHasAccess\":true,\"feedbackSurveyVariant\":0,\"tribeItem\":null,\"__typename\":\"Answer\",\"viewHash\":\"a-196135886_e2082e5d6acd0cb08a0fd603b817b174\",\"isSelectedForDigestClickthroughSurvey\":false,\"question\":{\"qid\":55534326,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDo1NTUzNDMyNg==\",\"isDeleted\":false,\"url\":\"/How-do-populations-deal-with-constant-war\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"How do populations deal with constant war?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"__typename\":\"Question\",\"isPartnerQuestion\":false,\"isTrendyQuestion\":false,\"isFollowUpQuestion\":false,\"asker\":{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjM3NzEyNzI0Mg==\",\"__typename\":\"User\",\"isEmployee\":false,\"uid\":377127242},\"slug\":\"How-do-populations-deal-with-constant-war\",\"network\":{\"nid\":0,\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\"},\"tribeItem\":null,\"answerCount\":1,\"suggestedReplies\":[]},\"permaUrl\":\"/How-do-populations-deal-with-constant-war/answer/Harry-Stevens-5\",\"isVisibleToViewer\":true,\"viewerIsAuthor\":false,\"isShortContent\":false,\"permaUrlOnOriginalQuestion\":\"/How-do-populations-deal-with-constant-war/answer/Harry-Stevens-5\",\"viewerCanRestoreAnswer\":false,\"__isMonetizable\":\"Answer\",\"oid\":196135886,\"contentType\":\"answer\",\"tribe\":null,\"viewer\":{\"consumerBundleSubscription\":null,\"id\":\"Vmlld2VyQDA6MA==\",\"tribeDirectSubscriptions\":[],\"user\":null,\"staticContent\":{\"title\":\"There is help\",\"contentQtextDocument\":{\"legacyJson\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Need Help? Contact a suicide hotline if you need someone to talk to. If you have a friend in need of help, please encourage that person to contact a suicide hotline as well.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Worldwide\\\\nIn general, if you're outside the US, numbers for your country are here: \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Help a friend - Befrienders Worldwide\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": 