.org/\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" at 1-800-273-TALK (8255).\\\\nPara espa\\u00f1ol, llame al \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"1-888-628-9454\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"#\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\".\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"unordered-list\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"id\":\"UXRleHREb2N1bWVudEAwOjkzYzA5ZjNjYjc4MmRkNGEzMWFiMTRmNjhiMWU2YzIz\"},\"staticContentType\":\"suicide_prevention_message\",\"internalUrl\":\"\",\"id\":\"U3RhdGljQ29udGVudEAwOnN1aWNpZGVfcHJldmVudGlvbl9tZXNzYWdl\"}},\"author\":{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjE3NjcxOTE2ODg=\",\"uid\":1767191688,\"__typename\":\"User\",\"useTranslatedName\":false,\"isMachineAnswerBot\":false,\"names\":[{\"__typename\":\"UserName\",\"id\":\"VXNlck5hbWU6MTc2NzE5MTY4ODpMQVRO\",\"reverseOrder\":false,\"givenName\":\"Fajim\",\"familyName\":\"\",\"scriptCode\":\"LATN\"}],\"adminNames\":[],\"isAnon\":false,\"profileUrl\":\"/profile/Fajim-1\",\"smallProfileImageUrl\":\"https://qph.cf2.quoracdn.net/main-thumb-1767191688-50-gqujxvjufavbsetmnljrdydifbyhzqca.jpeg\",\"profileImageUrl\":\"https://qph.cf2.quoracdn.net/main-thumb-1767191688-200-gqujxvjufavbsetmnljrdydifbyhzqca.jpeg\",\"isVerified\":false,\"businessStatus\":null,\"consumerBundleActive\":false,\"producerBundleStatus\":\"never_enrolled\",\"viewerHasMuted\":false},\"__isContentObject\":\"Answer\",\"isSensitive\":true,\"creationTime\":1732828885592529,\"hasSuicideTopics\":false,\"updatedTime\":0,\"authorTribeUser\":null,\"__isCredentialContainer\":\"Answer\",\"authorCredential\":{\"id\":\"RnJlZUZvcm1DcmVkZW50aWFsQDA6MTk0MTIwODUy\",\"__typename\":\"FreeFormCredential\",\"__isCredential\":\"FreeFormCredential\",\"translatedString\":\"A person who fights for Allah SWT\",\"credentialId\":194120852,\"isDefault\":false,\"isBad\":false,\"isEnqueued\":false,\"experience\":\"A person who fights for Allah SWT\"},\"isTranslated\":false,\"url\":\"/Why-do-populations-allow-themselves-to-be-lead-into-wars-that-are-against-their-own-interest/answer/Fajim-1\",\"isOwnTranslation\":false,\"businessCredential\":null,\"businessAnswer\":null,\"credibilityFacts\":[{\"__typename\":\"AuthorInfoFact\",\"id\":\"QXV0aG9ySW5mb0ZhY3RAMDoxNDc3NzQzODI5MjgxNjE5Ols2ODksIDYwOTEwXQ==\",\"viewCount\":60910,\"answerCount\":689}],\"sourceNetwork\":null,\"sourceQuestion\":null,\"sourceAnswer\":null,\"effectiveAccessOption\":\"free\",\"monetizationIneligibilityReasons\":[],\"notForReproduction\":false,\"numViews\":59,\"__isVotable\":\"Answer\",\"numUpvotes\":1,\"__isQuoraShareable\":\"Answer\",\"numShares\":0,\"moderationCollapseType\":null,\"numRequesters\":1,\"requesters\":[{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjE2MDgzNDMyMw==\",\"__typename\":\"User\",\"uid\":160834323,\"isAnon\":false,\"useTranslatedName\":false,\"isMachineAnswerBot\":false,\"names\":[{\"__typename\":\"UserName\",\"id\":\"VXNlck5hbWU6MTYwODM0MzIzOkxBVE4=\",\"reverseOrder\":false,\"givenName\":\"Paul\",\"familyName\":\"Mitchell\",\"scriptCode\":\"LATN\"}],\"adminNames\":[],\"profileUrl\":\"/profile/Paul-Mitchell-89\"}],\"isCommentsDisabled\":false,\"isCollapsedForViewer\":false,\"isModerationLocked\":false,\"moderationCollapseTypeUrl\":null,\"network\":{\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\",\"__typename\":\"Network\",\"contentLanguageCode\":\"en\",\"appealsFormUrl\":\"https://help.quora.com/hc/en/requests/new?ticket_form_id=198746\"},\"collapseOperation\":null,\"numDisplayComments\":1,\"__isReportable\":\"Answer\",\"reportableId\":1477743829281619,\"canViewerReport\":false,\"viewerVoteType\":\"novote\"}},\"cursor\":\"17\"},{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25QYWdlZExpc3RFZGdlOjE4\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionPagedListEdge\",\"node\":{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25SZWxldmFudEFuc3dlckl0ZW0yQDA6MzUwNzgwOTphbnN3ZXI6MTczNzQwMzMx\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"__isQuestionPagedListItem\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"question\":{\"qid\":3507809,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDozNTA3ODA5\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"When war affects a modern city, how long does it take after fighting ends before city life gets back to normal -- businesses operating at prewar levels, population growth, etc.?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"isQuestionDecanonActive\":true,\"areRelatedAnswersEnabled\":true},\"index\":14,\"isEquivalentAnswer\":false,\"relatedQuestion\":{\"qid\":58214410,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDo1ODIxNDQxMA==\"},\"answer\":{\"originalQuestionIfDifferent\":null,\"id\":\"QW5zd2VyQDA6MTczNzQwMzMx\",\"aid\":173740331,\"isDeleted\":false,\"isMachineAnswer\":false,\"content\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Does major war really benefit humanity by thinning out populations and creating millions of jobs?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"italic\\\": true}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Even though most people do not realise the true extent of population losses due to war, ethnic cleansing, genocides and attrocities those losses have not had significant impact.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Firstly, world wars have been so named because they have been fought around the world but not all the world has been involved or participated to a large degree. However devastating and horrendous the losses were, the total casualities are only a small proportion of the world\\\\u2019s population.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Secondly, the rebound after these events usually produces a substantial recovery. That is why we have the baby boomer generation. The world\\\\u2019s population boomed after WWII as people celebrated a new beginning.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"War or in particular, the military does produce employment for many. That is a fact. Hilter turned the economic fortunes of Germany around with military spending.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"questionPageImpressionHash\":\"answer_ranking|758383847\",\"viewerHasAccess\":true,\"feedbackSurveyVariant\":0,\"tribeItem\":null,\"__typename\":\"Answer\",\"viewHash\":\"a-173740331_d132e75a3fafb7841ab6360d151c4788\",\"isSelectedForDigestClickthroughSurvey\":false,\"question\":{\"qid\":58214410,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDo1ODIxNDQxMA==\",\"isDeleted\":false,\"url\":\"/Does-major-war-really-benefit-humanity-by-thinning-out-populations-and-creating-millions-of-jobs\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Does major war really benefit humanity by thinning out populations and creating millions of jobs?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"__typename\":\"Question\",\"isPartnerQuestion\":false,\"isTrendyQuestion\":false,\"isFollowUpQuestion\":false,\"asker\":{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjg5NjkzMDUzNA==\",\"__typename\":\"User\",\"isEmployee\":false,\"uid\":896930534},\"slug\":\"Does-major-war-really-benefit-humanity-by-thinning-out-populations-and-creating-millions-of-jobs\",\"network\":{\"nid\":0,\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\"},\"tribeItem\":null,\"answerCount\":7,\"suggestedReplies\":[]},\"permaUrl\":\"/Does-major-war-really-benefit-humanity-by-thinning-out-populations-and-creating-millions-of-jobs/answer/Harley-Vague-1\",\"isVisibleToViewer\":true,\"viewerIsAuthor\":false,\"isShortContent\":false,\"permaUrlOnOriginalQuestion\":\"/Does-major-war-really-benefit-humanity-by-thinning-out-populations-and-creating-millions-of-jobs/answer/Harley-Vague-1\",\"viewerCanRestoreAnswer\":false,\"__isMonetizable\":\"Answer\",\"oid\":173740331,\"contentType\":\"answer\",\"tribe\":null,\"viewer\":{\"consumerBundleSubscription\":null,\"id\":\"Vmlld2VyQDA6MA==\",\"tribeDirectSubscriptions\":[],\"user\":null,\"staticContent\":{\"title\":\"There is help\",\"contentQtextDocument\":{\"legacyJson\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Need Help? Contact a suicide hotline if you need someone to talk to. If you have a friend in need of help, please encourage that person to contact a suicide hotline as well.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Worldwide\\\\nIn general, if you're outside the US, numbers for your country are here: \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Help a friend - Befrienders Worldwide\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"http://www.befrienders.org/support/helplines.asp\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\". You can also e-mail \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"jo@samaritans.org\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"mailto:jo@samaritans.org\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" to talk to someone or visit \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"samaritans.org\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.samaritans.org/how-we-can-help-you/contact-us\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" to speak with someone.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"unordered-list\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"United States\\\\nCall the \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"National Suicide Prevention Lifeline\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\"