y and Wars \"},\"description\":\"The future can learnt from the past.\",\"isDefault\":false,\"isBad\":false,\"isEnqueued\":false,\"credentialId\":7321000},\"isTranslated\":false,\"url\":\"/Does-major-war-really-benefit-humanity-by-thinning-out-populations-and-creating-millions-of-jobs/answer/Harley-Vague-1\",\"isOwnTranslation\":false,\"businessCredential\":null,\"businessAnswer\":null,\"credibilityFacts\":[{\"__typename\":\"AuthorInfoFact\",\"id\":\"QXV0aG9ySW5mb0ZhY3RAMDoxNzM3NDAzMzE6WzcxMTYsIDEwMTU5MDgxXQ==\",\"viewCount\":10159081,\"answerCount\":7116}],\"sourceNetwork\":null,\"sourceQuestion\":null,\"sourceAnswer\":null,\"effectiveAccessOption\":\"free\",\"monetizationIneligibilityReasons\":[],\"notForReproduction\":false,\"numViews\":285,\"__isVotable\":\"Answer\",\"numUpvotes\":7,\"__isQuoraShareable\":\"Answer\",\"numShares\":0,\"moderationCollapseType\":null,\"numRequesters\":0,\"requesters\":[],\"isCommentsDisabled\":false,\"isCollapsedForViewer\":false,\"isModerationLocked\":false,\"moderationCollapseTypeUrl\":null,\"network\":{\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\",\"__typename\":\"Network\",\"contentLanguageCode\":\"en\",\"appealsFormUrl\":\"https://help.quora.com/hc/en/requests/new?ticket_form_id=198746\"},\"collapseOperation\":null,\"numDisplayComments\":0,\"__isReportable\":\"Answer\",\"reportableId\":173740331,\"canViewerReport\":false,\"viewerVoteType\":\"novote\"}},\"cursor\":\"18\"},{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25QYWdlZExpc3RFZGdlOjE5\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionPagedListEdge\",\"node\":{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25SZWxldmFudEFuc3dlckl0ZW0yQDA6MzUwNzgwOTphbnN3ZXI6MTIxNDI2NDIz\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"__isQuestionPagedListItem\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"question\":{\"qid\":3507809,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDozNTA3ODA5\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"When war affects a modern city, how long does it take after fighting ends before city life gets back to normal -- businesses operating at prewar levels, population growth, etc.?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"isQuestionDecanonActive\":true,\"areRelatedAnswersEnabled\":true},\"index\":15,\"isEquivalentAnswer\":false,\"relatedQuestion\":{\"qid\":41923486,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDo0MTkyMzQ4Ng==\"},\"answer\":{\"originalQuestionIfDifferent\":null,\"id\":\"QW5zd2VyQDA6MTIxNDI2NDIz\",\"aid\":121426423,\"isDeleted\":false,\"isMachineAnswer\":false,\"content\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Not very big. What makes the difference in many cases is not the absolute size of the city, but how the industries in the city run.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"For instance, I worked several summers in a town of 17 000 in Nova Scotia that had a major supermarket open 24 hours a day, not to mention convenience stores and coffee shops open 24 hours, because it had a number of industries that operated their plants 24 hours a day (including the factory where I had my summer job on the weekend graveyard shift). A couple of times I went grocery shopping at 3 or 4 am, and I was not alone in the store aisles.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"An hour away was a city of 300 000 that had no 24 hour supermarkets or coffee shops, because none of its industries ran 24 hours a day.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"questionPageImpressionHash\":\"answer_ranking|-220823221\",\"viewerHasAccess\":true,\"feedbackSurveyVariant\":0,\"tribeItem\":null,\"__typename\":\"Answer\",\"viewHash\":\"a-121426423_b1fd225d291f6bc28249cfe4d8319a3a\",\"isSelectedForDigestClickthroughSurvey\":false,\"question\":{\"qid\":41923486,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDo0MTkyMzQ4Ng==\",\"isDeleted\":false,\"url\":\"/How-big-does-a-city-need-to-be-population-wise-before-24-hour-services-start-to-be-readily-available-i-e-in-small-towns-all-businesses-will-close-at-night-while-in-large-cities-some-businesses-will-stay-open-around\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"How big does a city need to be, population wise, before 24 hour services start to be readily available? i.e. in small towns all businesses will close at night, while in large cities, some businesses will stay open around the clock.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"__typename\":\"Question\",\"isPartnerQuestion\":false,\"isTrendyQuestion\":false,\"isFollowUpQuestion\":false,\"asker\":{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjI1MDc5MDkxNQ==\",\"__typename\":\"User\",\"isEmployee\":false,\"uid\":250790915},\"slug\":\"How-big-does-a-city-need-to-be-population-wise-before-24-hour-services-start-to-be-readily-available-i-e-in-small-towns-all-businesses-will-close-at-night-while-in-large-cities-some-businesses-will-stay-open-around\",\"network\":{\"nid\":0,\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\"},\"tribeItem\":null,\"answerCount\":2,\"suggestedReplies\":[]},\"permaUrl\":\"/How-big-does-a-city-need-to-be-population-wise-before-24-hour-services-start-to-be-readily-available-i-e-in-small-towns-all-businesses-will-close-at-night-while-in-large-cities-some-businesses-will-stay-open-around/answer/James-Eaton-31\",\"isVisibleToViewer\":true,\"viewerIsAuthor\":false,\"isShortContent\":false,\"permaUrlOnOriginalQuestion\":\"/How-big-does-a-city-need-to-be-population-wise-before-24-hour-services-start-to-be-readily-available-i-e-in-small-towns-all-businesses-will-close-at-night-while-in-large-cities-some-businesses-will-stay-open-around/answer/James-Eaton-31\",\"viewerCanRestoreAnswer\":false,\"__isMonetizable\":\"Answer\",\"oid\":121426423,\"contentType\":\"answer\",\"tribe\":null,\"viewer\":{\"consumerBundleSubscription\":null,\"id\":\"Vmlld2VyQDA6MA==\",\"tribeDirectSubscriptions\":[],\"user\":null,\"staticContent\":{\"title\":\"There is help\",\"contentQtextDocument\":{\"legacyJson\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Need Help? Contact a suicide hotline if you need someone to talk to. If you have a friend in need of help, please encourage that person to contact a suicide hotline as well.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Worldwide\\\\nIn general, if you're outside the US, numbers for your country are here: \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Help a friend - Befrienders Worldwide\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"http://www.befrienders.org/support/helplines.asp\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\". You can also e-mail \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"jo@samaritans.org\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"mailto:jo@samaritans.org\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" to talk to someone or visit \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"samaritans.org\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.samaritans.org/how-we-can-help-you/contact-us\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" to speak with someone.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"unordered-list\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"United States\\\\nCall the \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"National Suicide Prevention Lifeline\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://suicidepreventionlifeline.org/\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" at 1-800-273-TALK (8255).\\\\nPara espa\\u00f1ol, llame al \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"1-888-628-9454\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"#\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\".\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"unordered-list\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"id\":\"UXRleHREb2N1bWVudEAwOjkzYzA5ZjNjYjc4MmRkNGEzMWFiMTRmNjhiMWU2YzIz\"},\"staticContentType\":\"suicide_prevention_message\",\"internalUrl\":\"\",\"id\":\"U3RhdGljQ29udGVudEAwOnN1aWNpZGVfcHJldmVudGlvbl9tZXNzYWdl\"}},\"author\":{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjI4MjEwOTg4Nw==\",\"uid\":282109887,\"__typename\":\"User\",\"useTranslatedName\":false,\"isMachineAnswerBot\":false,\"names\":[{\"__typename\":\"UserName\",\"id\":\"VXNlck5hbWU6MjgyMTA5ODg3OkxBVE4=\",\"reverseOrder\":false,\"givenName\":\"James\",\"familyName\":\"Eaton\",\"scriptCode\":\"LATN\"}],\"adminNames\":[],\"isAnon\":false,\"profileUrl\":\"/profile/James-Eaton-31\",\"smallProfileImageUrl\":\"https://qsf.cf2.quoracdn.net/-4-images.new_grid.profile_default.png-26-688c79556f251aa0.png\",\"profileImageUrl\":\"https://qsf.cf2.quoracdn.net/-4-images.new_grid.profile_default.png-26-688c79556f251aa0.png\",\"isVerified\":false,\"businessStatus\":null,\"consumerBundleActive\":false,\"producerBundleStatus\":\"never_enrolled\",\"viewerHasMuted\":false},\"__isContentObject\":\"Answer\",\"isSensitive\":false,\"creationTime\":1549511806647387,\"hasSuicideTopics\":false,\"updatedTime\":1646664225841791,\"authorTribeUser\":null,\"__isCredentialContainer\":\"Answer\",\"authorCredential\":{\"id\":\"V29ya0NyZWRlbnRpYWxAMDozOTIwNTEyNg==\",\"__typename\":\"WorkCredential\",\"__isCredential\":\"WorkCredential\",\"translatedString\":\"Instructor at Algonquin College (2012-present)\",\"isDefault\":false,\"isBad\":false,\"isEnqueued\":false,\"credentialId\":39205126,\"position\":\"Instructor\",\"endYear\":\"-1\",\"companyName\":null,\"company\":{\"tid\":68290,\"id\":\"VG9waWNAMDo2ODI5MA==\",\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"name\":\"Algonquin College\"},\"startYear\":\"2012\"},\"isTranslated\":false,\"url\":\"/How-big-does-a-city-need-to-be-population-wise-before-24-hour-services-start-to-be-readily-available-i-e-in-small-towns-all-businesses-will-close-at-night-while-in-large-cities-some-businesses-will-stay-open-around/answer/James-Eaton-31\",\"isOwnTranslation\":false,\"businessCredential\":null,\"businessAnswer\":null,\"credibilityFacts\":[{\"__typename\":\"AuthorInfoFact\",\"id\":\"QXV0aG9ySW5mb0ZhY3RAMDoxMjE0MjY0MjM6WzEyMzcsIDIzOTA4MTdd\",\"viewCount\":2390817,\"answerCount\":1237}],\"sourceNetwork\":null,\"sourceQuestion\":null,\"sourceAnswer\":null,\"effectiveAccessOption\":\"free\",\"monetizationIneligibilityReasons\":[],\"notForReproduction\":false,\"numViews\":131,\"__isVotable\":\"Answer\",\"numUpvotes\":5,\"__isQuoraShareable\":\"Answer\",\"numShares\":0,\"moderationCollapseType\":null,\"numRequesters\":0,\"requesters\":[],\"isCommentsDisabled\":false,\"isCollapsedForViewer\":false,\"isModerationLocked\":false,\"moderationCollapseTypeUrl\":null,\"network\":{\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\",\"__typename\":\"Network\",\"contentLanguageCode\":\"en\",\"appealsFormUrl\":\"https://help.quora.com/hc/en/requests/new?ticket_form_id=198746\"},\"collapseOperation\":null,\"numDisplayComments\":1,\"__isReportable\":\"Answer\",\"reportableId\":121426423,\"canViewerReport\":false,\"viewerVoteType\":\"novote\"}},\"cursor\":\"19\"},{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25QYWdlZExpc3RFZGdlOjIw\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionPagedListEdge\",\"node\":{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25SZWxldmFudEFuc3dlckl0ZW0yQDA6MzUwNzgwOTphbnN3ZXI6MTQ3Nzc0MzY2MDU1NjkwMA==\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"__isQuestionPagedListItem\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"question\":{\"qid\":3507809,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDozNTA3ODA5\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"When war affects a modern city, how long does it take after fighting ends before city life gets back to normal -- businesses operating at prewar levels, population growth, etc.?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"isQuestionDecanonActive\":true,\"areRelatedAnswersEnabled\":true},\"index\":16,\"isEquivalentAnswer\":false,\"relatedQuestion\":{\"qid\":158800424,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDoxNTg4MDA0MjQ=\"},\"answer\":{\"originalQuestionIfDifferent\":null,\"id\":\"QW5zd2VyQDA6MTQ3Nzc0MzY2MDU1NjkwMA==\",\"aid\":1477743660556900,\"isDeleted\":false,\"isMachineAnswer\":false,\"content\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Any country can be divided into two parts. The \\\\\\\"A-country\\\\\\\" is the big cities, the industrial and population centers and the resource concentration they represent. Big cities got to be that way because they are in desirable locations,near good ports, river crossings or mountain passes. When the city goes, so does the locations. The \\\\\\\"B-country\\\\\\\" is everything else. In effect the A-country represents big vulnerable collections of assets gathered into single spots. The B-country represents dispersed ranges of resources spread over large areas.This is a very important distinction. The relative value of the A-country and the B-country depends on the country and society involved. However one thing is constant, the support and supplies that the A-country needs to survive comes from the B-country. Given time, the B-country will rebuild the A-country. The survival of the B-country is, therefore, critical while the survival of the A-country might not be. Now, the primary asset of the B-country is its population; they are the ones who will generate resources from the B-country and turn them into product. So, the critical thing for a post nuclear environment is population. Save as much of that as we can and we're a jump ahead\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"So we're in a race. Can we rebuild the B-country so that its firstly self-sustaining without the services provided by the A-country while the stockpile of pre-attack assets survive. Can we reconstruct a working society fast enough so that we can feed enough people to keep going? Can the surviving women bear enough children (and survive doing so) to replace the death toll. For the loss won't stop with the attack. Diseases we consider trivial today, measles, chickenpox, influenza, will be mass killers. No medical treatment. Unless your lucky enough to be where some medical facilities have survived, a broken leg that gets infected is likely to be a death sentence. Its possible to look on this world as a 17th century US colonial environment and there's a lot of truth in that. The downside is that the colonial pioneers didn't have the decaying charnel houses of the cities to worry about. This is another key thing to bear in mind; many more people will die after a nuclear exchange and will die in it.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Eventually when conditions permit, our new society moves back to rebuild the A-country. It'll be a long, long time before there is another Federal Government(such things need technology to survive - a calculated guess is that it would take two centuries before a powerful central government evolved again - if it evolves again).\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Excerpted from:\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Nuclear Warfare 101\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.giantbomb.com/fallout-3/3030-20504/forums/nuclear-warfare-101-wall-of-text-alert-2999/\\\"}}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"questionPageImpressionHash\":\"answer_ranking|-885018474\",\"viewerHasAccess\":true,\"feedbackSurveyVariant\":0,\"tribeItem\":null,\"__typename\":\"Answer\",\"viewHash\":\"a-1477743660556900_95080a89c241943bee7930359e722b9c\",\"isSelectedForDigestClickthroughSurvey\":false,\"question\":{\"qid\":158800424,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDoxNTg4MDA0MjQ=\",\"isDeleted\":false,\"url\":\"/How-long-does-it-take-to-rebuild-a-city-country-after-a-nuclear-attack-How-many-people-could-live-in-such-an-area-during-reconstruction\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"How long does it take to rebuild a city/country after a nuclear attack? How many people could live in such an area during reconstruction?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"__typename\":\"Question\",\"isPartnerQuestion\":false,\"isTrendyQuestion\":false,\"isFollowUpQuestion\":false,\"asker\":{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjE4MTA5MTMzNDM=\",\"__typename\":\"User\",\"isEmployee\":false,\"uid\":1810913343},\"slug\":\"How-long-does-it-take-to-rebuild-a-city-country-after-a-nuclear-attack-How-many-people-could-live-in-such-an-area-during-reconstruction\",\"network\":{\"nid\":0,\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\"},\"tribeItem\":null,\"answerCount\":2,\"suggestedReplies\":[]},\"permaUrl\":\"/How-long-does-it-take-to-rebuild-a-city-country-after-a-nuclear-attack-How-many-people-could-live-in-such-an-area-during-reconstruction/answer/Robert-Gauthier\",\"isVisibleToViewer\":true,\"viewerIsAuthor\":false,\"isShortContent\":false,\"permaUrlOnOriginalQuestion\":\"/How-long-does-it-take-to-rebuild-a-city-country-after-a-nuclear-attack-How-many-people-could-live-in-such-an-area-during-reconstruction/answer/Robert-Gauthier\",\"viewerCanRestoreAnswer\":false,\"__isMonetizable\":\"Answer\",\"oid\":1477743660556900,\"contentType\":\"answer\",\"tribe\":null,\"viewer\":{\"consumerBundleSubscription\":null,\"id\":\"Vmlld2VyQDA6MA==\",\"tribeDirectSubscriptions\":[],\"user\":null,\"staticContent\":{\"title\":\"There is help\",\"contentQtextDocument\":{\"legacyJson\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Need Help? Contact a suicide hotline if you need someone to talk to. If you have a friend in need of help, please encourage that person to contact a suicide hotline as well.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Worldwide\\\\nIn general, if you're outside the US, numbers for your country are here: \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"Help a friend - Befrienders Worldwide\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"http://www.befrienders.org/support/helplines.asp\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\". You can also e-mail \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"jo@samaritans.org\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"mailto:jo@samaritans.org\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" to talk to someone or visit \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"samaritans.org\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.samaritans.org/how-we-can-help-you/contact-us\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" to speak with someone.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"unordered-list\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"United States\\\\nCall the \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"National Suicide Prevention Lifeline\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://suicidepreventionlifeline.org/\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" at 1-800-273-TALK (8255).\\\\nPara espa\\u00f1ol, llame al \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"1-888-628-9454\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"#\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\".\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"unordered-list\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"id\":\"UXRleHREb2N1bWVudEAwOjkzYzA5ZjNjYjc4MmRkNGEzMWFiMTRmNjhiMWU2YzIz\"},\"staticContentType\":\"suicide_prevention_message\",\"internalUrl\":\"\",\"id\":\"U3RhdGljQ29udGVudEAwOnN1aWNpZGVfcHJldmVudGlvbl9tZXNzYWdl\"}},\"author\":{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjE4NjAx\",\"uid\":18601,\"__typename\":\"User\",\"useTranslatedName\":false,\"isMachineAnswerBot\":false,\"names\":[{\"__typename\":\"UserName\",\"id\":\"VXNlck5hbWU6MTg2MDE6TEFUTg==\",\"reverseOrder\":false,\"givenName\":\"Robert\",\"familyName\":\"Gauthier\",\"scriptCode\":\"LATN\"}],\"adminNames\":[],\"isAnon\":false,\"profileUrl\":\"/profile/Robert-Gauthier\",\"smallProfileImageUrl\":\"https://qph.cf2.quoracdn.net/main-thumb-18601-50-yenzgpkaatrfbxptohnpiqpkwjikhpxs.jpeg\",\"profileImageUrl\":\"https://qph.cf2.quoracdn.net/main-thumb-18601-200-yenzgpkaatrfbxptohnpiqpkwjikhpxs.jpeg\",\"isVerified\":false,\"businessStatus\":null,\"consumerBundleActive\":false,\"producerBundleStatus\":\"never_enrolled\",\"viewerHasMuted\":false},\"__isContentObject\":\"Answer\",\"isSensitive\":false,\"creationTime\":1682010187501007,\"hasSuicideTopics\":false,\"updatedTime\":0,\"authorTribeUser\":null,\"__isCredentialContainer\":\"Answer\",\"authorCredential\":null,\"isTranslated\":false,\"url\":\"/How-long-does-it-take-to-rebuild-a-city-country-after-a-nuclear-attack-How-many-people-could-live-in-such-an-area-during-reconstruction/answer/Robert-Gauthier\",\"isOwnTranslation\":false,\"businessCredential\":null,\"businessAnswer\":null,\"credibilityFacts\":[{\"__typename\":\"AuthorInfoFact\",\"id\":\"QXV0aG9ySW5mb0ZhY3RAMDoxNDc3NzQzNjYwNTU2OTAwOlsyMDM0NSwgODcyMDUwMF0=\",\"viewCount\":8720500,\"answerCount\":20345}],\"sourceNetwork\":null,\"sourceQuestion\":null,\"sourceAnswer\":null,\"effectiveAccessOption\":\"free\",\"monetizationIneligibilityReasons\":[],\"notForReproduction\":false,\"numViews\":654,\"__isVotable\":\"Answer\",\"numUpvotes\":2,\"__isQuoraShareable\":\"Answer\",\"numShares\":0,\"moderationCollapseType\":null,\"numRequesters\":0,\"requesters\":[],\"isCommentsDisabled\":false,\"isCollapsedForViewer\":false,\"isModerationLocked\":false,\"moderationCollapseTypeUrl\":null,\"network\":{\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\",\"__typename\":\"Network\",\"contentLanguageCode\":\"en\",\"appealsFormUrl\":\"https://help.quora.com/hc/en/requests/new?ticket_form_id=198746\"},\"collapseOperation\":null,\"numDisplayComments\":0,\"__isReportable\":\"Answer\",\"reportableId\":1477743660556900,\"canViewerReport\":false,\"viewerVoteType\":\"novote\"}},\"cursor\":\"20\"},{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25QYWdlZExpc3RFZGdlOjIx\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionPagedListEdge\",\"node\":{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25SZWxldmFudEFuc3dlckl0ZW0yQDA6MzUwNzgwOTphbnN3ZXI6MTQ5NTYwNDk1\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"__isQuestionPagedListItem\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"question\":{\"qid\":3507809,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDozNTA3ODA5\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"When war affects a modern city, how long does it take after fighting ends before city life gets back to normal -- businesses operating at prewar levels, population growth, etc.?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"isQuestionDecanonActive\":true,\"areRelatedAnswersEnabled\":true},\"index\":17,\"isEquivalentAnswer\":false,\"relatedQuestion\":{\"qid\":50852449,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDo1MDg1MjQ0OQ==\"},\"answer\":{\"originalQuestionIfDifferent\":null,\"id\":\"QW5zd2VyQDA6MTQ5NTYwNDk1\",\"aid\":149560495,\"isDeleted\":false,\"isMachineAnswer\":false,\"content\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Caen was reduced to rubble by bombing and artillery during the fighting in Normandy. You\\\\u2019d have to look with a keen eye to notice it now.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Dresden was even more comprehensively destroyed by fire bombing. This takes only minimal perceptiveness to discern now. There is no old quarter, no historic core such as graces, oh, say, Delft. There is an old cathedral right by the Elbe, but that\\\\u2019s about it. Otherwise, things are, or at any rate in 1991 were, kind of tatty modern utilitarian construction.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"And the mind\\\\u2019s eye can hardly fail to supply the firestorm, and the river\\\\u2019s contribution to saving just the few stone buildings that graced its banks.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"The battlefield of Verdun used to be home to several villages. They were utterly destroyed and never rebuilt. Mines and unexploded ordinance still infest the land. Trees have grown up but none are mature, and the shape of the ground itself resembles a storm wracked sea. There is no flat place. The mind\\\\u2019s eye works it out. These are somewhat slumped shell craters, one atop the other. Superficially, there\\\\u2019s not much to see. Keep looking, and it\\\\u2019s mute tragedy.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"questionPageImpressionHash\":\"answer_ranking|-1313043252\",\"viewerHasAccess\":true,\"feedbackSurveyVariant\":0,\"tribeItem\":null,\"__typename\":\"Answer\",\"viewHash\":\"a-149560495_2c18ed91f4ebf6fb38260b0fb6e38b58\",\"isSelectedForDigestClickthroughSurvey\":false,\"question\":{\"qid\":50852449,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDo1MDg1MjQ0OQ==\",\"isDeleted\":false,\"url\":\"/What-do-the-cities-towns-etc-pictures-optional-look-like-now-that-were-once-warzones-in-WWI-WWII\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"What do the cities/towns etc. (pictures optional) look like now that were once warzones in WWI/WWII?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"__typename\":\"Question\",\"isPartnerQuestion\":false,\"isTrendyQuestion\":false,\"isFollowUpQuestion\":false,\"asker\":{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjY4NDUwNjQ1NA==\",\"__typename\":\"User\",\"isEmployee\":false,\"uid\":684506454},\"slug\":\"What-do-the-cities-towns-etc-pictures-optional-look-like-now-that-were-once-warzones-in-WWI-WWII\",\"network\":{\"nid\":0,\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\"},\"tribeItem\":null,\"answerCount\":3,\"suggestedReplies\":[]},\"permaUrl\":\"/What-do-the-cities-towns-etc-pictures-optional-look-like-now-that-were-once-warzones-in-WWI-WWII/answer/Doug-Hensley-8\",\"isVisibleToViewer\":true,\"viewerIsAuthor\":false,\"isShortContent\":false,\"permaUrlOnOriginalQuestion\":\"/What-do-the-cities-towns-etc-pictures-optional-look-like-now-that-were-once-warzones-in-WWI-WWII/answer/Doug-Hensley-8\",\"viewerCanRestoreAnswer\":false,\"__isMonetizable\":\"Answer\",\"oid\":149560495,\"contentType\":\"answer\",\"tribe\":null,\"viewer\":{\"consumerBundleSubscription\":null,\"id\":\"Vmlld2VyQDA6MA==\",\"tribeDirectSubscriptions\":[],\"user\":null,\"staticContent\":{\"title\":\"There is help\",\"contentQtextDocument\":{\"legacyJson\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Need Help? Contact a suicide hotline if you need someone to talk to. If you have a friend in need of help, please encourage that person to contact a suicide hotline as well.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\