one or visit \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"samaritans.org\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://www.samaritans.org/how-we-can-help-you/contact-us\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" to speak with someone.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"unordered-list\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}, {\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"United States\\\\nCall the \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"National Suicide Prevention Lifeline\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://suicidepreventionlifeline.org/\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\" at 1-800-273-TALK (8255).\\\\nPara espa\\u00f1ol, llame al \\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\"1-888-628-9454\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {\\\"link\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"url\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"#\\\"}}}, {\\\"text\\\": \\\".\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"unordered-list\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"id\":\"UXRleHREb2N1bWVudEAwOjkzYzA5ZjNjYjc4MmRkNGEzMWFiMTRmNjhiMWU2YzIz\"},\"staticContentType\":\"suicide_prevention_message\",\"internalUrl\":\"\",\"id\":\"U3RhdGljQ29udGVudEAwOnN1aWNpZGVfcHJldmVudGlvbl9tZXNzYWdl\"}},\"author\":{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjE4NDgyNzk4Ng==\",\"uid\":184827986,\"__typename\":\"User\",\"useTranslatedName\":false,\"isMachineAnswerBot\":false,\"names\":[{\"__typename\":\"UserName\",\"id\":\"VXNlck5hbWU6MTg0ODI3OTg2OkxBVE4=\",\"reverseOrder\":false,\"givenName\":\"Michael\",\"familyName\":\"Hutson\",\"scriptCode\":\"LATN\"}],\"adminNames\":[],\"isAnon\":false,\"profileUrl\":\"/profile/Michael-Hutson-8\",\"smallProfileImageUrl\":\"https://qph.cf2.quoracdn.net/main-thumb-184827986-50-ikgltikifkwgwjvsvpiyyrjpawjobdtx.jpeg\",\"profileImageUrl\":\"https://qph.cf2.quoracdn.net/main-thumb-184827986-200-ikgltikifkwgwjvsvpiyyrjpawjobdtx.jpeg\",\"isVerified\":false,\"businessStatus\":null,\"consumerBundleActive\":false,\"producerBundleStatus\":\"never_enrolled\",\"viewerHasMuted\":false},\"__isContentObject\":\"Answer\",\"isSensitive\":true,\"creationTime\":1570471216153570,\"hasSuicideTopics\":false,\"updatedTime\":0,\"authorTribeUser\":null,\"__isCredentialContainer\":\"Answer\",\"authorCredential\":{\"id\":\"TGlmZUV4cGVyaWVuY2VDcmVkZW50aWFsQDA6MTQzNTA4MjA=\",\"__typename\":\"LifeExperienceCredential\",\"__isCredential\":\"LifeExperienceCredential\",\"translatedString\":\"armchair pundit\",\"experience\":{\"id\":\"VG9waWNAMDoxMDAyNg==\",\"__typename\":\"Topic\",\"tid\":10026,\"name\":\"Nuclear Weapons\"},\"description\":\"armchair pundit\",\"isDefault\":false,\"isBad\":false,\"isEnqueued\":false,\"credentialId\":14350820},\"isTranslated\":false,\"url\":\"/Does-major-war-really-benefit-humanity-by-thinning-out-populations-and-creating-millions-of-jobs/answer/Michael-Hutson-8\",\"isOwnTranslation\":false,\"businessCredential\":null,\"businessAnswer\":null,\"credibilityFacts\":[{\"__typename\":\"AuthorInfoFact\",\"id\":\"QXV0aG9ySW5mb0ZhY3RAMDoxNzI1Mzk5MDE6WzQxMTUsIDMwMjAxNDhd\",\"viewCount\":3020148,\"answerCount\":4115}],\"sourceNetwork\":null,\"sourceQuestion\":null,\"sourceAnswer\":null,\"effectiveAccessOption\":\"free\",\"monetizationIneligibilityReasons\":[],\"notForReproduction\":false,\"numViews\":142,\"__isVotable\":\"Answer\",\"numUpvotes\":2,\"__isQuoraShareable\":\"Answer\",\"numShares\":0,\"moderationCollapseType\":null,\"numRequesters\":0,\"requesters\":[],\"isCommentsDisabled\":false,\"isCollapsedForViewer\":false,\"isModerationLocked\":false,\"moderationCollapseTypeUrl\":null,\"network\":{\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\",\"__typename\":\"Network\",\"contentLanguageCode\":\"en\",\"appealsFormUrl\":\"https://help.quora.com/hc/en/requests/new?ticket_form_id=198746\"},\"collapseOperation\":null,\"numDisplayComments\":1,\"__isReportable\":\"Answer\",\"reportableId\":172539901,\"canViewerReport\":false,\"viewerVoteType\":\"novote\"}},\"cursor\":\"26\"},{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25QYWdlZExpc3RFZGdlOjI3\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionPagedListEdge\",\"node\":{\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25SZWxldmFudEFuc3dlckl0ZW0yQDA6MzUwNzgwOTphbnN3ZXI6MjUyMTU4NzM=\",\"__typename\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"__isQuestionPagedListItem\":\"QuestionRelevantAnswerItem2\",\"question\":{\"qid\":3507809,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDozNTA3ODA5\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"When war affects a modern city, how long does it take after fighting ends before city life gets back to normal -- businesses operating at prewar levels, population growth, etc.?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"isQuestionDecanonActive\":true,\"areRelatedAnswersEnabled\":true},\"index\":23,\"isEquivalentAnswer\":false,\"relatedQuestion\":{\"qid\":9224779,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDo5MjI0Nzc5\"},\"answer\":{\"originalQuestionIfDifferent\":null,\"id\":\"QW5zd2VyQDA6MjUyMTU4NzM=\",\"aid\":25215873,\"isDeleted\":false,\"isMachineAnswer\":false,\"content\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Well it depends if you mean now, or in the past. In WWII, the biggest reason why the Red Army was able to overcome the Germans to the point where the Wehrmarcht had to hire old men and children to defend the country at the end of the war is, well, the URSS had a lot of people and even if they trade 4 to 1 in term of casulties, they would still win at the end of the day. The same argument goes for why ROC was able to fend the Japanese invasion despite having extremely inferior equipment, why the PRC was able to force a standstill against the United Nation Forces in Korea and why the US lost the Vietnam War. The current PLA has 2 million fighting men because, well, they only need that much. You don\\\\u2019t often hear news about China sending her troops overseas to conduct military operations in foreign lands now, do you? However, should the necessities arise, if China decides to use all her industrial abilities and change her policy to contribute to the war effort, she won\\\\u2019t have a problem at all with increasing the size of the PLA and its fellow branches. Also, in war, if every strategy fails, there\\\\u2019s always the attrition strategy if you have more people than your opponent so having a big population means you will have a much more reliable and feasible plan B should your plan A fails.\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"questionPageImpressionHash\":\"answer_ranking|1394941592\",\"viewerHasAccess\":true,\"feedbackSurveyVariant\":0,\"tribeItem\":null,\"__typename\":\"Answer\",\"viewHash\":\"a-25215873_33845ce1f32d6c8407226a45f5a92926\",\"isSelectedForDigestClickthroughSurvey\":false,\"question\":{\"qid\":9224779,\"id\":\"UXVlc3Rpb25AMDo5MjI0Nzc5\",\"isDeleted\":false,\"url\":\"/Is-it-disadvantage-to-have-huge-population-when-your-country-is-at-war\",\"title\":\"{\\\"sections\\\": [{\\\"spans\\\": [{\\\"text\\\": \\\"Is it disadvantage to have huge population when your country is at war?\\\", \\\"modifiers\\\": {}}], \\\"indent\\\": 0, \\\"quoted\\\": false, \\\"type\\\": \\\"plain\\\", \\\"is_rtl\\\": false}]}\",\"__typename\":\"Question\",\"isPartnerQuestion\":false,\"isTrendyQuestion\":false,\"isFollowUpQuestion\":false,\"asker\":{\"id\":\"VXNlckAwOjEwNTQ3MjUxMg==\",\"__typename\":\"User\",\"isEmployee\":false,\"uid\":105472512},\"slug\":\"Is-it-disadvantage-to-have-huge-population-when-your-country-is-at-war\",\"network\":{\"nid\":0,\"id\":\"TmV0d29yazow\"},\"tribeItem\":null,\"answerCount\":2,\"suggestedReplies\":[]},\"permaUrl\":\"/Is-it-disadvantage-to-have-huge-population-when-your-country-is-at-war/answer/Joshua-Field-2\",\"isVisibleToViewer\":true,\"viewerIsAuthor\":false,\"isShortContent\":false,\"permaUrlOnOriginalQuestion\":\"/Is-it-disadvantage-to-have-huge-population-when-your-country-is-at-war/answer